  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **i'm danicing in the show tonight**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **never squeal on the pusher**: back after 38 archived shows (997 days) [2]\n- **paradise city tease**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **la grange tease**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **hot for teacher tease**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **pumpin 4 the man**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: tear for eddie [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1997-07-24** (recommended): audience recording; 37 songs; 156 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Claude broke his drum pedal, forcing the band to skip him for the next section [1]\n- The band experienced a false start while attempting to perform the HIV song [1]\n- Claude was absent from the stage for the entire run from Little Birdy to Squelch the Weasel [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1997-07-24**: source: unknown AUD [1]",
